From 714d47d6e480e6d7d749df4c9375340b41cdc710 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mauro Persano <mauro.persano@kdab.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:42:50 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] assimp plugin: handle morph targets with mixed attributes

We were computing the size of all morph target buffers based on the
attributes of the first morph target. This breaks when we have morph
targets with different attributes.

Fixes: QTBUG-150977
Pick-to: 6.11 6.8
Change-Id: Ia35ef9597fbc965da42af8da438d811104cb52f5
Reviewed-by: Mike Krus <mike.krus@kdab.com>
(cherry picked from commit 1eefe29327c5d7dd6020c5dd0735eb8e5e798f05)
Reviewed-by: Qt Cherry-pick Bot <cherrypick_bot@qt-project.org>

